== Trivia ==
* {{i|The Polaroid}} was originally a trinket in the original Binding of Isaac, but it was changed into an [[item]]. It had the trinket ID 47 which is now empty.
** {{t|Wiggle Worm}} was an item in the original Binding of Isaac; however, in Rebirth, it was changed into a [[trinket]]. Interestingly, these changes keep the count of items and trinkets from the original game the same.
* {{dlc|a+}} Afterbirth+'s original trinket count was 29. The [[Booster Pack]]s added 9 trinkets.
* [[enboi:Game Squid|Game Squid]] is the only trinket from the original Binding of Isaac that wasn't implemented into Rebirth or any of its DLCs. This is likely due to it having been added in the Eternal Edition update after Rebirth's release.
** {{T|Chewed Pen}}, a trinket added in Repentance, has a nearly identical effect to Game Squid.
* The game has a set "order" of trinkets that will appear. So, for example, if a trinket is encountered as a room drop, then going back in time with the {{i|Glowing Hourglass}}, the next trinket that drops from any source will always be that same trinket. This is also why {{i|Guppy's Eye}} can show the same trinket in two different chests; as the next drop is technically that trinket, no matter which chest is opened. Opening that chest and getting that trinket will cause the other chest to change its drop to a different trinket.

